WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
There is a roadkiller among the tailmen

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,600
Roadkiller will issue a fatal hit after death.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,200
Choose to die with one person

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,900
perish

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,300
Is Roadkiller so scary?

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:17,230
